OL,3,GNEWSARelocation of birthing centre
OL,4,Aservices begins
OL,5,
OL,6,FMaternity services at a birthing centre
OL,7,Fin Melton are being relocated to a
OL,8,Fnearby hospital from this week.
OL,10,FThe relocation of antenatal and
OL,11,Fpostnatal clinics from St Mary's Birth
OL,12,FCentre to Melton Hospital began on
OL,13,FMonday, following a decision in March
OL,14,Fto close the centre for good.
OL,16,FStaff at St Mary's said the dates and
OL,17,Ftimes of any booked appointments would
OL,18,Fremain the same but would be held at
OL,19,FMelton Hospital.
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (E) NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,365,360,200,160,0,100
