OL,3,GNEWSARelocation of birthing centre
OL,4,Aservices begins
OL,5,
OL,6,FIn a statement, the centre said: "We
OL,7,Fare hoping to ensure the transition is
OL,8,Fas smooth as we can possibly make it
OL,9,Ffor our families, however, we naturally
OL,10,Fanticipate there may be a few bumps in
OL,11,Fthe road."
